The preflight default expects the controller-sealed plan at the sibling path:

SEALED-C3S-FULL2-CONFIRMATORY-PLAN.md

That file is intentionally absent.  The draft in the C3-S screen package is
not launch authority and must not be copied or treated as sealed by this
engineering task.  A controller must publish the final 0444 plan and matching
`.sha256` sidecar before preflight can pass.

